7: File
8:   Property localization = "on"
12: Character 村长
13:   Property voice = "/Game/RPG/VO/Mayor"
15: Character 猎户
17: Character 玩家 player
21: Fact 见过村长: bool
22: Fact 见过猎户: bool
23: Fact 村长好感: int range 0..10 = 0
24: Fact 狼杀了: int extern
25: Fact 头狼死了: bool extern
26: Fact 村庄被袭: bool extern
27: Fact 金币: int extern
31: Chapter 序章
33: Chapter 第一章 after 序章
34:   Implied
35:     Implication 见过村长 = true
36:   Advance -> 第二章 if 猎狼.completed
38: Chapter 第二章 after 第一章
39:   Implied
40:     Implication 狼杀了 = 5
41:     Implication 头狼死了 = true
45: Quest 猎狼 was 猎狼任务
46:   Property title = "猎狼"
47:   Property priority = "main"
48:   Flag track
49:   Property timeout = "20m"
50:   Available ((chapter == 第一章) and (not 猎狼.completed))
51:   Journal
52:     Property accepted = "村长说狼在北边的林子里,先清掉五只。"
53:     Property going = "还差 {5 - 狼杀了} 只。" parts=['还差 ' {(5 - 狼杀了)} ' 只。']
54:     Property completed = "林子清净了。回去找村长。"
55:     Property failed = "狼群先动手了。"
56:   Objective (狼杀了 >= 5)
57:     Property show = "猎狼 {狼杀了}/5" parts=['猎狼 ' {狼杀了} '/5']
58:   Objective 见过猎户 optional
59:     Property show = "去林边找猎户"
60:   FailIf 村庄被袭
61:   On accept
62:     Command set 狼杀了 = 0
63:     Command emit 任务板刷新
64:   On complete
65:     Command set 村长好感 += 1
66:     Reward 金币 x50
67:     Reward 物品 狼牙 x3
68:   On timeout
69:     Command emit 任务板刷新
70:   Subquest 猎狼_头狼 auto
72: Quest 猎狼_头狼
73:   Property title = "头狼"
74:   Property priority = "main"
75:   Flag track
76:   Journal
77:     Property accepted = "猎户说狼群有个头,左耳缺一块。"
78:     Property completed = "头狼倒下了。"
79:   Objective 头狼死了
80:     Property show = "击杀头狼"
81:   On accept
82:     Command play 头狼登场
83:   On complete
84:     Reward 金币 x200
85:     Reward 经验 x500
89: Dialogue 村长_初见 for 村长 if (not 见过村长)
90:   Speech 村长 "你就是新来的?"
91:   Command set 见过村长 = true
92:   Command advance 第一章
93:   Jump 村长_派活
95: Dialogue 村长_派活
96:   Speech 村长 "北边的林子里有狼,已经叼走两只羊了。"
97:   Choice "我去。"
98:     Command accept 猎狼
99:     Speech 村长 "五只。回来我有赏。"
100:   Choice "我考虑一下。"
101:     Speech 村长(不耐烦) "别考虑太久。"
102:   Jump end
105: Dialogue 村长_再派活 for 村长 if ((见过村长 and 猎狼.available) and (not 猎狼.failed))
106:   Jump 村长_派活
108: Dialogue 村长_进行中 for 村长 if 猎狼.active
109:   Speech 村长 "还差 {5 - 狼杀了} 只。" parts=['还差 ' {(5 - 狼杀了)} ' 只。']
110:   Choice "狼在哪?" once
111:     Speech 村长 "北边。跟着羊骨头走。"
112:   Choice "知道了。"
114: Dialogue 村长_失败 for 村长 if 猎狼.failed
115:   Speech 村长(阴沉) "羊圈空了。"
116:   Choice "再给我一次机会。" if=猎狼.available
117:     Command accept 猎狼
118:   Choice "……"
120: Dialogue 村长_完成 for 村长 if (猎狼.completed and (not 猎狼_头狼.completed))
121:   Speech 村长 "林子安静了?好。"
122:   Speech 村长 "不过猎户说……那群狼有个头。"
124: Dialogue 村长_全清 for 村长 if 猎狼_头狼.completed
125:   If (村长好感 >= 3)
126:     Speech 村长(笑) "老朋友,村子欠你的。"
127:   Else
128:     Speech 村长 "猎人,村子欠你的。"
130: Dialogue 村长_日常 for 村长
131:   Speech 村长 "忙你的去。"
135: Dialogue 猎户_初见 for 猎户 if (not 见过猎户)
136:   Speech 猎户(警惕) "你不是村里人。"
137:   Command set 见过猎户 = true
138:   If 猎狼.active
139:     Speech 猎户 "村长派你来的?那群狼有个头,别单独碰它。"
140:   Choice "头狼长什么样?" if=猎狼.active once
141:     Speech 猎户 "左耳缺一块。见到就跑。"
142:   Choice "告辞。"
144: Dialogue 猎户_日常 for 猎户
145:   Speech 猎户 "林子今天很安静。" if=猎狼.completed
146:   Speech 猎户 "小心点。" if=(not 猎狼.completed)
147:   Command wait 0.5s
148:   Speech 猎户 "走吧。"
152: Stage 头狼登场
153:   Duration 6s
154:   Shots
155:     Shot 头狼特写 local ( 0 , - 120 , 40 ) look 头狼 fov 30
156:     Shot 全景 local ( 0 , - 400 , 200 ) look 头狼 fov 60
157:   Track camera
158:     StageEntry 0s blend from game 0.3s
159:     StageEntry 2s cut -> 头狼特写
160:     StageEntry 4.5s cut -> 全景
161:     StageEntry 6s blend back 0.4s
162:   Track mask
163:     StageEntry 1.9s..2.1s distort strength 0.8
164:     StageEntry 4.4s..4.6s fade black 0.1s
165:   Track anim
166:     StageEntry 2s montage AM_头狼_咆哮 actor 头狼
167:   Track vfx
168:     StageEntry 2.1s spawn / Game / FX / NS_Howl
169:   Track ui
170:     StageEntry 0s hide hud
171:   Track game
172:     StageEntry 0s..6s input lock
173:     StageEntry 2s..2.3s hitstop 0.2 x
174:   Restore
175:     RestoreEntry ui show hud
